                        "Model_type": "Deep learning: DINOv3 ViT-B/16 image encoder (448x896 grayscale page, ImageNet normalisation, bfloat16), StandardScaler + logistic regression heads on its 1536-d feature (code: HeartWise-AI/DeepECG_Docker models/dinov3_bank.py).",
                        "Supported_DICOM_modalities": "ECG (waveform), DOC (Encapsulated PDF), OT (secondary capture)"
