                        "Directions": "Send the ECG study (waveform preferred). Read each output as a model score; a flag is given only where a validation threshold exists.",
                        "Not_intended_use": "Diagnosis, triage or treatment decisions."
                      },
                      "Warnings_and_limitations": {
                        "Research_only": "No regulatory clearance, no calibration analysis, no external validation.",
                        "Input_fidelity": "Waveforms sampled at a multiple of 250 Hz give the training pixels exactly; PDFs are redrawn from their vector traces; images are used as they are and are the least validated input.",
                        "Numerics": "Features are computed under bfloat16 autocast, as at probe fitting; GPU kernels differ from the training run's by about 1e-3 in probability (more on steep heads).",
                        "Provenance_gap": "The probe fits recorded no git commit (closest: DeepECG-PNG probe-fairness 08a2933).",
